{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1523902-character-creation-question","id":1523902,"title":"Character creation question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-10-09T21:55:03-07:00","id":1523902,"title":"Character creation question","content":"Delving into the continuum and started reading character creation when a question was raised.<br /> <br /> when you are choosing or making your three paths the book say with each path you get three skill points but those points can not be used on a skill that is associated with another path. Does this mean that I can\u2019t use character points on skills that are a part of another Path at all? Or that I can\u2019t use skill points on skills that have no connection to the path I gained the points from?<br /> <br /> for example: street rat has the following skills - Athletics, Enigmas, Larceny, Survival. Combat specialist (role path) has the following skills - Aim, Athletics, Close Combat, Integrity.<br /> <br /> Athletics is on both paths but is technically also associated with those paths so when I am spending my skill points can I use the Origin path skill points on athletics sense it is associated with a different path as well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11720-redwulfe","name":"Redwulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11720_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-10T03:07:00-07:00","id":1523906,"title":"","content":"The idea is you can only use the dots on the skill related to that specific path, not on any path skill.<br /> <br /> So Street Rat dots can be used on Street Rat skills, Combat Specialist on Combat Specialist and so on.<br /> <br /> In other words, you can buy Athletics with both path dots, but if the third path doesn\u2019t have Athletics on the list you can\u2019t use those dots on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}